# ============================================================================
# RS_VR_Weapons, THE VANILLA SET -- THE PLASMA RIFLE PICKUP'S PAIR (WMSHEET.plasma).
#
# A weapon sheet says what a gun shoots; its model card (the reload lane's library) says what the gun is. Every
# number here is TODAY'S, copied unchanged from the gun's class Default block (WM_Gun.* properties, lower case),
# its card's capacity / firesfrom / firesound and its second barrel's shot -- so loading these changes no gun.
# Proof: `wm_card check` empty and the `wm_card all` printout unchanged. Written by the weapons lane, 09-14.
# ============================================================================

# THE SET'S ONE EFFECT SWITCH (owner, 2026-10-03: "vanilla and v+ use ours or
# vanilla"). Off -- the default -- every gun here looks as it does today. On, each gun
# takes its `instead` block: a flash of light at the muzzle and nothing else.
# LOOK ONLY. WM_Sheet refuses a damage, rate-of-fire or alt-fire key inside an instead
# block by name, so this switch cannot move what any of these guns DO.
effectswitch = wm_vanilla_look

gun "WM_PlasmaRifle"
  firetics             = 3
  fullauto             = true
  shotclass            = "RSB_PlasmaBall"
  releasetics          = 20
  flashprofile         = "plasma_rifle"
  capacity             = 50
  firesfrom            = magazine
  firesound            = "weapons/plasmaf"
  recoilprofile        = "plasma_rifle"
  instead
    flashprofile  = "vanilla_plasma"
    ejectaprofile = "none"
    trailprofile  = "none"
    recoilprofile = "none"
    muzzlethrow   = "none"
  end

end

gun "WM_PlasmaRifleBlue"
  firetics             = 3
  fullauto             = true
  shotclass            = "RSB_PlasmaBallCarbine"
  releasetics          = 20
  flashprofile         = "plasma_carbine"
  capacity             = 50
  firesfrom            = magazine
  firesound            = "weapons/plasmaf"
  recoilprofile        = "plasma_carbine"
  instead
    flashprofile  = "vanilla_plasma"
    ejectaprofile = "none"
    trailprofile  = "none"
    recoilprofile = "none"
    muzzlethrow   = "none"
  end

end
